items.CozyRanch_Armor_Raven_Head.description=Raven's Thrift: each Raven piece you wear gives a 5% chance that an arrow you shoot from a bow or crossbow comes back to you. Wear all four for a 25% chance.
items.CozyRanch_Armor_Raven_Chest.description=Raven's Thrift: each Raven piece you wear gives a 5% chance that an arrow you shoot from a bow or crossbow comes back to you. Wear all four for a 25% chance.
items.CozyRanch_Armor_Raven_Hands.description=Raven's Thrift: each Raven piece you wear gives a 5% chance that an arrow you shoot from a bow or crossbow comes back to you. Wear all four for a 25% chance.
items.CozyRanch_Armor_Raven_Legs.description=Raven's Thrift: each Raven piece you wear gives a 5% chance that an arrow you shoot from a bow or crossbow comes back to you. Wear all four for a 25% chance.
